    gmeow:comment "OEIS A001620 is the decimal expansion of the Euler–Mascheroni constant γ — a locator for the digits of math:eulerMascheroni, a related resource rather than the constant's identity, so skos:relatedMatch. Link-only (OEIS is CC BY-SA 4.0, aligned by reference)." ;
    gmeow:sssomFile "gmeow-oeis.sssom.tsv" .

